Galaxy Editor embeds two subset fonts so the language list can draw Latin,
Cyrillic, Chinese, and Korean without depending on fonts installed on the machine.
The subsets contain only the characters used by the editor's translations.

GalaxyLatin.ttf is a subset of DejaVu Sans.
